"Licensed Materials" means the MA2A source code, reference implementations, protocol documentation, examples, tests, benchmark code, and other copyrighted materials distributed with this license.
"Non-Commercial Research Use" means use whose primary purpose is academic research, education, teaching, evaluation, reproducibility, or experimentation and which is not performed for commercial advantage or monetary compensation.
"Commercial Use" means use of the Licensed Materials, in whole or in part, for commercial advantage, monetary compensation, revenue-generating products or services, paid consulting or integration, internal production/business operations, or development of a commercial product or service.
"MA2A Official Network" means an infrastructure explicitly designated by the project owner as part of the official MA2A trust domain, including official trust anchors, organizational credentials, certification, directories, relays, or related managed services.

